    <div class="stat"><div class="stat-label">集成流程</div><div class="stat-val">8</div><div class="stat-delta">源: int_flow COUNT</div></div>
    <div class="stat"><div class="stat-label">扩展插件</div><div class="stat-val">15</div><div class="stat-delta">源: exts_plugin_version</div></div>
  </div>

  <div class="card-grid-2">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title">🖥️ 服务健康状态</div>
      <table><thead><tr><th>服务</th><th>端口</th><th>状态</th><th>响应时间</th></tr></thead><tbody>
        <tr><td>bone-system</td><td style="font-family:monospace;font-size:12px">8083</td><td><span class="tag tag-ok">UP</span></td><td style="color:var(--tt);font-size:12px">12ms</td></tr>
        <tr><td>bone-iam</td><td style="font-family:monospace;font-size:12px">8081</td><td><span class="tag tag-ok">UP</span></td><td style="color:var(--tt);font-size:12px">8ms</td></tr>
        <tr><td>bone-metadata-server</td><td style="font-family:monospace;font-size:12px">8084</td><td><span class="tag tag-ok">UP</span></td><td style="color:var(--tt);font-size:12px">15ms</td></tr>
        <tr><td>bone-integration</td><td style="font-family:monospace;font-size:12px">8085</td><td><span class="tag tag-w">UNKNOWN</span></td><td style="color:var(--tt);font-size:12px">— (远端未探活)</td></tr>
        <tr><td>bone-extension-studio</td><td style="font-family:monospace;font-size:12px">8088</td><td><span class="tag tag-ok">UP</span></td><td style="color:var(--tt);font-size:12px">10ms</td></tr>
      </tbody></table>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title">💻 资源使用 (JVM)  <span style="font-weight:400;font-size:12px;color:var(--tt);margin-left:8px">memory used/max</span></div>
      <div style="margin-bottom:12px">
        <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px"><span style="color:var(--ts)">堆内存</span><span style="color:var(--t);font-weight:500">2.1GB / 4.0GB (52%)</span></div>
        <div style="width:100%;height:8px;background:var(--bs);border-radius:4px"><div style="width:52%;height:100%;background:var(--p);border-radius:4px"></div></div>
      </div>
      <table><thead><tr><th>JVM 指标</th><th>值</th></tr></thead><tbody>
        <tr><td>Threads Live</td><td style="font-family:monospace;font-size:12px">142</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Threads Daemon</td><td style="font-family:monospace;font-size:12px">38</td></tr>
        <tr><td>GC Pause (avg)</td><td style="font-family:monospace;font-size:12px">18ms</td></tr>
      </tbody></table>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card-grid-2">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title">⚡ 快捷操作 (6 固定入口)</div>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px">
        <button class="btn btn-d" onclick="navTo('iam')" style="justify-content:flex-start;width:100%">👤 IAM 管理</button>
        <button class="btn btn-d" onclick="navTo('metadata')" style="justify-content:flex-start;width:100%">🗄 元数据管理</button>
        <button class="btn btn-d" onclick="navTo('masterdata')" style="justify-content:flex-start;width:100%">📊 主数据管理</button>
        <button class="btn btn-d" onclick="navTo('integration')" style="justify-content:flex-start;width:100%">🔗 集成管理</button>
        <button class="btn btn-d" onclick="navTo('system')" style="justify-content:flex-start;width:100%">⚙ 系统管理</button>
        <button class="btn btn-d" onclick="navTo('extension')" style="justify-content:flex-start;width:100%">🧩 扩展管理</button>
      </div>
      <p style="font-size:11px;color:var(--tt);margin-top:10px">💡 [Target] 改为 cnsl_quick_action 表驱动，按租户/角色过滤。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
