  <div id="ext-logs-dynamic" style="display:none"></div>
</template>

<template id="tpl-ext-plugins">
  <div class="toolbar"><div class="toolbar-l"><button class="btn btn-p">+ 创建插件</button><button class="btn btn-d btn-sm">上传 JAR</button></div></div>
  <div class="card" style="padding:0;overflow:hidden">
    <table><thead><tr><th>插件名称</th><th>绑定扩展点</th><th>版本</th><th>灰度</th><th>状态</th><th>操作</th></tr></thead><tbody>
      <tr><td style="font-weight:500">标准计价</td><td style="font-family:monospace;font-size:11px">order.pre.create</td><td>v1.3.0</td><td><span class="tag tag-i">100%</span></td><td><span class="tag tag-ok">Active</span></td><td><button class="btn btn-l btn-sm">:bind</button><button class="btn btn-l btn-sm">:deploy</button><button class="btn btn-l btn-sm">版本</button></td></tr>
      <tr><td style="font-weight:500">VIP会员计价</td><td style="font-family:monospace;font-size:11px">order.pre.create</td><td>v2.0.1</td><td><span class="tag tag-w">30%</span></td><td><span class="tag tag-ok">Active</span></td><td><button class="btn btn-l btn-sm">:unbind</button><button class="btn btn-l btn-sm">:rollback</button></td></tr>
  </tbody></table></div>
  <p style="font-size:11px;color:var(--tt);margin-top:8px">
    💡 <b>热部署边界</b>：当前 :deploy 只更新路由元数据 + is_active（经 Redis publish-runtime），不动态加载 JAR 字节码。类须已在宿主 classpath。字节码热载 (独立 ClassLoader) 属 [Target]。
  </p>
</template>

<template id="tpl-ext-deploy">
  <div class="card">
    <div class="card-title">部署状态机</div>
    <div class="state-machine">
      <div class="state-node uploaded">Uploaded</div><div class="state-arrow"></div>
      <div class="state-node validated">Validated</div><div class="state-arrow"></div>
      <div class="state-node">Staged</div><div class="state-arrow"></div>
      <div class="state-node active">Active</div><div class="state-arrow"></div>
      <div class="state-node deprecated">Deprecated</div>
    </div>
    <p style="font-size:11px;color:var(--tt);margin-top:8px;text-align:center">
      📐 API: GET /plugins/{id}/deployment-state → DeploymentStateDiagram。回滚：Active → 切回上一 Validated 版本 + 重新 publish-runtime。
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="card-title">LRO 部署流程 (默认 202 + GET /operations/{id} 轮询)</div>
    <div class="lro-bar">
      <div class="dot"></div>
      <div class="msg">部署中: 标准计价 v1.3.0</div>
      <div class="lro-progress"><div class="lro-fill"></div></div>
      <div class="detail">65% · 校验 checksum SHA-256...</div>
    </div>
    <p style="font-size:11px;color:var(--tt);margin-top:8px;">
      💡 ?sync=true 可同步返回 200。幂等键 Idempotency-Key 同键异 body → 409 COMMON_IDEMPOTENCY_CONFLICT。
    </p>
  </div>
</template>

